ine-specific treatment","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every other error, including other "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"URLError"},{"type":"text","text":" codes, falls back to the generic treatment."}]},{"text":"The secondary action slot","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"The-secondary-action-slot"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Both default Error placeholders take an optional ","type":"text"},{"code":"secondaryAction: (title: String, action: () -> Void)?","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" alongside ","type":"text"},{"code":"onRetry","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — a second button for something other than retrying, like going back to the previous screen instead of hammering a request that’s going to fail the same way again:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["ScreenStateDefaultErrorView(error: error, onRetry: reload, secondaryAction: (title: \"Go Back\", action: goBack))","ScreenStateDefaultErrorUIView(error: error, onRetry: reload, secondaryAction: (title: \"Go Back\", action: goBack))"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" by default, so every existing call site keeps showing just Retry (or nothing, if "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onRetry"},{"type":"text","text":" is also "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"text":") until you opt in.","type":"text"}]},{"level":2,"text":"A user-facing message, distinct from localizedDescription","anchor":"A-user-facing-message-distinct-from-localizedDescription","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"error.localizedDescription"},{"type":"text","text":" is often a debugging string, or — for a plain "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Error"},{"type":"text","text":" with no "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CustomStringConvertible"},{"type":"text","text":"\/"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LocalizedError"},{"type":"text","text":" conformance — ju